data: {"run_id":"88fceffdc4624a08af9f35c5104782ad","seq":10,"stage":"respond","status":"ok","parent":null,"label":"10","data":{"action":"answer_briefly","system":"You are a career agent inside a job-search product. Answer the user's career question helpfully and concretely. This message is adjacent to what you are for: answer in at most two sentences, then say in a few words what you mainly help with.","max_tokens":120,"max_chars":500,"provider":"anthropic","model":"claude-haiku-4-5","text":"Here's a clean recursive solution with memoization for efficiency:\n\n```python\ndef fib(n, memo={}):\n    if n in memo:\n        return memo[n]\n    if n <= 1:\n        return n\n    memo[n] = fib(n-1, memo) + fib(n-2, memo)\n    return memo[n]\n```\n\nOr iteratively if you prefer:\n```python\ndef fib(n):\n    if n <= 1:\n        return n\n    ","truncated":false,"recorded_at":"2026-10-29T14:33:24+00:00","replayed":true},"ms":1208,"tokens":213,"cost_usd":0.000693}

